<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Inference scheme and performance discrepancy</h3>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We describe in the following the comparison between different inference schemes and the discrepancy between reported and reproduced performance.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T11" class="ltx_table">
